{# ============================================================ ACADEMIC NETWORK (register)
   Proof for the "Study" venture — Admizz Education's partner-university
   network — presented in THIS site's own document language, not copied from
   either reference: not admizzeducation.com's own logo-carousel-with-filter-
   tabs (that's their UI, and it's also the generic B2B "trusted by" wall
   every SaaS site runs), not a shadow-card grid either (rillet.com's
   discipline: flat, hairline rules, one accent, no glow).

   Instead: a country-by-country register, same idiom as /ventures/'s
   numbered records and this site's .data-row component (used already on
   /about/'s timeline and /ventures/'s facts). Each row expands via Alpine's
   collapse plugin (@alpinejs/collapse, already registered in main.js) into
   the real institution list — a directory entry, not a marketing wall.

   Subordinate placement, deliberately: sits AFTER "Our Ventures" so it
   reads as evidence supporting the venture register, not a headline claim
   of its own — the group site is reporting on what one of its three
   businesses has built, not presenting the whole group as an admissions
   consultancy (see CLAUDE.md's register-translation note, RESUME-PROMPT.md). #}
<section class="bg-paper py-section-sm md:py-section border-t border-rule">
  <div class="shell">
    <div class="max-w-[42rem] fade-up">
      <span class="eyebrow">Across Admizz Education</span>
      <h2 class="mt-3 font-display font-light text-h2 text-ink">{{ universities.totalCount }} partner institutions, {{ universities.groups.length }} countries.</h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-body-lg text-ink-muted max-w-measure-tight">
        The academic network behind Admizz Education's admissions work, indexed by country.
        Figures and partner names published by Admizz Education, as of 2026.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 fade-up" style="animation-delay:90ms" x-data="{ open: null }">
      {% for group in universities.groups %}
      <div>
        <button
          type="button"
          class="academic-network-row"
          @click="open = open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? null : {{ loop.index0 }}"
          :aria-expanded="open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? 'true' : 'false'"
          aria-controls="network-panel-{{ group.code }}"
        >
          <span class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="text-body" aria-hidden="true">{{ group.flag }}</span>
            <span class="font-mono text-small uppercase tracking-widest text-ink">{{ group.country }}</span>
          </span>
          <span class="flex items-center gap-4">
            <span class="font-mono text-small text-ink-faint">{{ group.universities.length }} institution{{ "s" if group.universities.length != 1 }}</span>
            <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"
              class="academic-network-chevron text-ink-faint transition-transform duration-press ease-signature"
              :class="open === {{ loop.index0 }} ? 'rotate-180' : ''">
              <path d="M2.5 4.5L6 8l3.5-3.5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
            </svg>
          </span>
        </button>
        <div id="network-panel-{{ group.code }}" x-show="open === {{ loop.index0 }}" x-collapse x-cloak>
          <ul class="academic-network-list">
            {% for u in group.universities %}
            <li class="academic-network-item">
              <span class="academic-network-mark-box" aria-hidden="true">
                <img src="{{ u.logo }}" alt="" loading="lazy" class="academic-network-mark">
              </span>
              {{ u.name }}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
